warning[lint-requote-rate] at legs[0].body[0]: block `requote` submits an order on every wake of `tick`, which fires on every frame of `ticks` (about every 50 ms); the runtime will coalesce and rate-limit it, so the strategy trades at the gate's pace, not yours
